    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78131" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακατ-έχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>keep back, detain</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.66.5
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>restrain</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινας</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.93
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὁρμήν τινος, τὸν ἴδιον
				θυμόν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.67.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.4.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὰς ὠδῖνας</span>
			<i>check</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὰ ὑγρά</span>
			<i>checks</i> their <i>circulation</i>, Heraclid.Tar. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.64f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>retain possession of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ἀκροκόρινθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					18.45.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be detained</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ Σαράπιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>UPZ</u>
					8.19
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>.</div>
